# Read by entryGuard.js on every check cycle -- edits here take effect live,
# no restart needed (adding a brand-new symbol does need a restart, since the
# option chain for a new underlying is only loaded once at startup).
#
# One line per underlying: SYMBOL LOW,HIGH[,PCT]
# entryGuard.js only buys a CE whose current premium (LTP) falls inside
# [LOW, HIGH] for that underlying, and only once the OI-drop + price-up
# signal has also fired for it.
#
# PCT is optional: what percentage of available equity-segment margin to
# deploy into that entry (e.g. "NIFTY 10,20,10" = 10% of available funds).
# Omit it to deploy the maximum quantity available margin allows.

NIFTY 10,20
SENSEX 20,30
